    "description": "Requests against the fcp-sfd-object-processor API. Mirrors docs/openapi/v1.json in the fcp-sfd-object-processor repository.\n\nEvery request except Health and Process upload request (the CDP Uploader callback) requires a bearer token. Set the `token` collection variable before running them.",
